---RAM* program---
PC=00
 1: +000          BOOTSTRAP  PROGRAM:                                         
 2: +000          For loading instructions                                    
 3: +000          from  Input  into memory.                                   
 4: +000 -                                                                    
 5: +000 -                                                                    
 6: +000          The bootstrap is just the                                   
 7: +000          "001" hardwired into memory cell 00                         
 8: +000          (due to David Hagelbarger, Bell Laboratories).              
 9: +000 -                                                                    
10: +000          PC must start at memory cell  00.                           
11: +000 -                                                                    
12: +000 -                                                                    
13: +000          Bootstrap  INPUT  format example:                           
14: +000 -                                                                    
15: +000            002  -For                                                 
16: +000            700  - Boot.                                              
17: +000            010  -memory address, for                                 
18: +000            030  -program instruction.                                
19: +000            011  -address                                             
20: +000            031  -instruction                                         
21: +000            012  -address                                             
22: +000            230  -instruction                                         
23: +000            013  -address                     = ADD.RAM program       
24: +000            431  -instruction                                         
25: +000            014  -address                                             
26: +000            332  -instruction                                         
27: +000            015  -address                                             
28: +000            132  -instruction                                         
29: +000            016  -address                                             
30: +000            910  -instruction                                         
31: +000 -                                                                    
32: +000 -                                                                    
33: +000         -See  also  FBOOT.RAM                                        
